#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "132_Rank 0"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "¿A qué te refieres?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "144_Kiryu"
msgid "This town cleans up after itself. Even if I weren't here, there're plenty of others with the guts to make Kamurocho a better place."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Rank 0
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "156_Rank 0"
msgid "You mean the Kamurocho Guard? What could those pathetic neighborhood watch pussies possibly do? They're the ones that needed your help in the first place!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P8
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "168_Kiryu"
msgid "They may be small and weak now, but everyone has to start somewhere."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "180_Kiryu"
msgid "The Kamurocho Guard is going to get stronger. I can see the potential in them－something your group could never have."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "192_Kiryu"
msgid "They are devoted to their cause. I think that's what people need the most."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "204_Kiryu"
msgid "And that's why I'm helping them survive through their early growing pains."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Rank 0
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "216_Rank 0"
msgid "Heh... I guess we'll find out if they're really as strong as you say."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Rank 0
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "228_Rank 0"
msgid "Word of advice. You better be careful that you too don't get crushed by someone more powerful than yourself. Later."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
